      "id": 78,
      "clave": "system.heroText",
      "title": "LEXDIBRI began as a project by three 4Geeks students who decided to find a technological solution to a problem we found in Spanish healthcare.",
      "description": "LEXDIBRI began as a project by three 4Geeks students who decided to find a technological solution to a problem we found in Spanish healthcare."
    },
    {
      "id": 79,
      "clave": "system.historyText",
      "title": "During the project we observed that healthcare information can be spread across different services and autonomous communities, making access to certain resources or relevant information difficult.",
      "description": "During the project we observed that healthcare information can be spread across different services and autonomous communities, making access to certain resources or relevant information difficult."
    },
    {
      "id": 80,
      "clave": "system.techText",
      "title": "To turn our idea into a functional platform, we used different technologies and tools learned during our training.",
      "description": "To turn our idea into a functional platform, we used different technologies and tools learned during our training."
    },
    {
      "id": 81,
      "clave": "system.goalText",
      "title": "LEXDIBRI is our attempt to show how technology can make healthcare information more accessible, clear and simple for citizens.",
      "description": "LEXDIBRI is our attempt to show how technology can make healthcare information more accessible, clear and simple for citizens."
    },
    {
      "id": 82,
      "clave": "diagnosis.introText",
      "title": "From systems capable of analysing medical images with artificial intelligence to surgical robots and treatments that direct radiation with extraordinary precision, technology is expanding the possibilities of modern medicine.",
